concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016-sch-1-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 At the end of section 315A"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (2) However, if:  (a) a *proceeds of crime authority applies for a *forfeiture order relating to particular property; and  (b) a person applies for an order (the exclusion order) under section 29 or 29A to exclude a specified *interest in that property from a *restraining order; and  (c) the application for the exclusion order has not been withdrawn; the court may only hear the application for the forfeiture order after the application for the exclusion order has been determined." ;
    skos:definition "Add:  (2) However, if:  (a) a *proceeds of crime authority applies for a *forfeiture order relating to particular property; and  (b) a person applies for an order (the exclusion order) under section 29 or 29A to exclude a specified *interest in that property from a *restraining order; and  (c) the application for the exclusion order has not been withdrawn; the court may only hear the application for the forfeiture order after the application for the exclusion order has been determined."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "910f57d009526c010f6f93fe0c32bcb6a7a37d1ba5d8a788c0084129041ad2a1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Court may only hear application for forfeiture order after exclusion order has been determined." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
