doc:sch-2-sec-490-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "490(4) 1  Intentional false dealing with accounting documents" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) An offence against this section committed by an individual is punishable on conviction by imprisonment for not more than 10 years, a fine not more than 10,000 penalty units, or both.  Schedule 2  False accounting  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Proceeds of Crime and Other Measures) Act 2016 No. 15, 2016  Penalty for body corporate" ;
