    values:originalText "Insert: accounting document means:  (a) any account; or  (b) any record or document made or required for any accounting purpose; or  (c) any register under the Corporations Act 2001, or any financial report or financial records within the meaning of that Act.  Schedule 3  Serious drugs  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Proceeds of Crime and Other Measures) Act 2016 No. 15, 2016" ;
