doc:sch-3-sec-3-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "3(4) Subsection 301.9(2) of the Criminal Code" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) In this section: addition has its ordinary meaning. replacement has its ordinary meaning.  Serious drugs  Schedule 3  No. 15, 2016 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Proceeds of Crime and Other Measures) Act 2016" ;
