concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016-sch-4-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Section 5 (definition of foreign law enforcement agency)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the definition, substitute: foreign law enforcement agency means:  (a) a government body that has responsibility for law enforcement in a foreign country or a part of a foreign country; or  (b) the European Police Office (Europol); or  (c) the International Criminal Police Organization (Interpol); or  (d) an international body prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this paragraph." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the definition, substitute: foreign law enforcement agency means:  (a) a government body that has responsibility for law enforcement in a foreign country or a part of a foreign country; or  (b) the European Police Office (Europol); or  (c) the International Criminal Police Organization (Interpol); or  (d) an international body prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this paragraph."@en ;
