concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016-sch-4-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 At the end of subsection 22(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "Add:  ; and (j) in the case of the Independent Commissioner Against Corruption of South Australia:  (i) a person appointed as the Independent Commissioner Against Corruption under the Independent Commissioner Against Corruption Act 2012 (SA) or acting in that office; and  (ii) a person appointed as the Deputy Commissioner under that Act or acting in that office; and  (iii) a person appointed as an examiner or investigator under that Act.  Secrecy and access of AUSTRAC information  Schedule 4  No. 15, 2016 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Proceeds of Crime and Other Measures) Act 2016" ;
    skos:definition "Add:  ; and (j) in the case of the Independent Commissioner Against Corruption of South Australia:  (i) a person appointed as the Independent Commissioner Against Corruption under the Independent Commissioner Against Corruption Act 2012 (SA) or acting in that office; and  (ii) a person appointed as the Deputy Commissioner under that Act or acting in that office; and  (iii) a person appointed as an examiner or investigator under that Act.  Secrecy and access of AUSTRAC information  Schedule 4  No. 15, 2016 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Proceeds of Crime and Other Measures) Act 2016"@en ;
