concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016-sch-4-sec-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5 Application provision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-5 ;
    values:originalText "Paragraph 122(3)(c) of the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006, as inserted by this Schedule, applies in relation to the disclosure of information after the commencement of this item, whether the information was obtained before or after that commencement.  Schedule 5  Disclosure etc. of AusCheck scheme personal information  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Proceeds of Crime and Other Measures) Act 2016 No. 15, 2016" ;
    skos:definition "Paragraph 122(3)(c) of the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006, as inserted by this Schedule, applies in relation to the disclosure of information after the commencement of this item, whether the information was obtained before or after that commencement.  Schedule 5  Disclosure etc. of AusCheck scheme personal information  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Proceeds of Crime and Other Measures) Act 2016 No. 15, 2016"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e87761a373f76fe9cfd0ab6cb1b2263b6dcc37c79a7a39b7b65837685e23b587" ;
    cof:pageNumber "21"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application provision for disclosure of information after commencement" ;
